<!doctype html>
<html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Gym Progress Tracker</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css"></head>
<body>
<section id="authScreen" class="auth-screen">
  <div class="auth-card">
    <div class="auth-brand"><b>G<span>+</span></b><div><strong>GYM TRACKER</strong><small>TRAINING INTELLIGENCE</small></div></div>
    <p class="auth-kicker">TU ENTRENAMIENTO, BAJO CONTROL</p>
    <h1 id="authTitle">Inicia sesión<span>.</span></h1>
    <p class="auth-subtitle" id="authSubtitle">Accede a tu espacio personal de entrenamiento.</p>
    <form id="authForm" class="auth-form">
      <label id="authNameWrap" hidden>Nombre completo<input id="authName" autocomplete="name" maxlength="100" placeholder="Tu nombre"></label>
      <label>Correo electrónico<input id="authEmail" type="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="correo@ejemplo.com"></label>
      <label>Contraseña<input id="authPassword" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" minlength="8" required placeholder="Mínimo 8 caracteres"></label>
      <p id="authError" class="auth-error" role="alert"></p>
      <button class="primary auth-submit" id="authSubmit">Iniciar sesión</button>
    </form>
    <p class="auth-switch"><span id="authSwitchText">¿No tienes cuenta?</span> <button type="button" id="authToggle">Crear cuenta</button></p>
  </div>
</section>
<div id="appShell" hidden>
<aside class="sidebar"><div class="brand"><b>G<span>+</span></b><div><strong>GYM TRACKER</strong><small>TRAINING INTELLIGENCE</small></div></div><label>WORKSPACE</label><nav>
<button class="active" data-page="dashboard">▦　Dashboard</button><button data-page="exercises">◈　Ejercicios</button><button data-page="routines">▤　Rutinas</button><button data-page="sessions">◷　Sesiones</button><button data-page="progress">↗　Progreso</button></nav><div class="side-bottom"><div class="tip"><span>✦</span><b>Tu progreso, sin límites.</b><p>Registra cada sesión. Construye mejores hábitos.</p></div><button data-page="profile">⚙　Mi perfil</button><div class="user"><i id="sideInitials">JL</i><div><b id="sideName">Jordan Luna</b><small>Atleta</small></div><button id="logoutButton" class="logout-button">Cerrar sesión</button></div></div></aside>
<main><header><button id="menu" class="menu">☰</button><div>WORKSPACE　/　<b id="crumb">DASHBOARD</b></div><span id="today"></span></header>
<section id="dashboard" class="page active"><div class="heading"><div><small>TU CENTRO DE ENTRENAMIENTO</small><h1>Dashboard<span>.</span></h1><p>Tu esfuerzo de hoy construye los resultados de mañana.</p></div><button class="primary" data-modal="session">＋ Registrar sesión</button></div>
<div class="hero"><div><small>POTENCIAL EN CONSTRUCCIÓN</small><h2>Entrena con intención.</h2><p>La constancia convierte los objetivos en resultados medibles.</p></div><div class="weekly"><small>OBJETIVO SEMANAL</small><strong id="weeklyCount">0 <em>/ 5</em></strong><div class="bar"><i id="weeklyBar" style="width:0%"></i></div><small id="weeklyPercent">0% completado</small></div><div class="orbit">G<span>+</span></div></div>
<div class="section-title"><div><h3>Resumen de actividad</h3><p>Indicadores principales de tu entrenamiento</p></div><span class="pill">ESTA SEMANA　⌄</span></div>
<div class="stats"><article><small>SESIONES</small><b id="statSessions">0</b><p>Sesiones registradas</p></article><article><small>VOLUMEN TOTAL</small><b id="statVolume">0 <i>kg</i></b><p>Volumen acumulado</p></article><article><small>PESO CORPORAL</small><b id="statWeight">—</b><p>Peso aún no registrado</p></article><article><small>EJERCICIOS</small><b id="statExercises">0</b><p><span>ACTIVOS</span> en tu biblioteca</p></article></div>
<div class="columns"><article class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Volumen de entrenamiento</h3><p>Rendimiento semanal · kilogramos</p></div><span class="pill">ÚLTIMOS 7 DÍAS</span></div><div class="chart"><div class="y"><span>3k</span><span>2k</span><span>1k</span><span>0</span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 600 190" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path class="grid" d="M0 10H600M0 65H600M0 120H600M0 175H600"/><path class="area" d=""/><path class="line" d=""/></svg></div><div class="days"><span>LUN</span><span>MAR</span><span>MIÉ</span><span>JUE</span><span>VIE</span><span>SÁB</span><span>DOM</span></div></article>
<article class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Distribución muscular</h3><p>Enfoque de tus sesiones</p></div></div><div id="muscleMap" class="muscle-map">
<div class="muscle-map-layout">
